        "exact_text": "I am a market researcher, and I want to analyze pricing trends in the online book market. Please collect book data from https://books.toscrape.com, covering the first 2 pages with at least 30 books. For each book, I need: title, price as numeric without the £ symbol, rating on a 1-5 scale, and availability.\n",
